        <name>nextSeq</name>
        <qualifiedname>dap::nextSeq</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Return the next monotonically increasing DAP sequence number. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Every DAP message (request, response, event) must carry a unique seq field. This function provides the global counter shared across all message types.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>The next sequence number, starting at 1.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Not thread-safe. Must only be called on the main thread. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
